l mvar\" style=\"font-style:italic\">f</span>. The inverse of <span class=\"texhtml mvar\" style=\"font-style:italic\">f</span> exists if and only if <span class=\"texhtml mvar\" style=\"font-style:italic\">f</span> is bijective, and if it exists, is denoted by <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/63d2b575826d75cfdbc1bea2f34ccfa71f1c59b7\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.671ex;width:4.3ex;height:3.009ex\" /></span></p>"}